  "title": "A first new high on strong volume, bought and hedged with the market",
  "why": "Investors anchor on the past year's high and are slow to bid through it, so good news near the high is taken in late (George and Hwang 2004). A close at a new high on heavy volume, the first in a month, is the moment that resistance gives way. The effect is documented over months; whether the first week holds any of it is the test.",
